th the extraction AND consider it a coherent \"reveal intent + remove duplication\" refactoring around cell keying. The rename of `live` → `liveCells` is separate enough that I'll leave `live` as is to keep it truly one change. Actually `live` is fine and reads naturally with `.has()`.\n\nDecision: Extract `cellKey(x, y)` helper to remove duplication of the \"x,y\" key format and reveal intent.\n\nLet me now run the tests first to confirm green, then make the change, then run tests again.\n\nLet me also check the package.json and how tests are run.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me examine the project setup and run the tests first to confirm the baseline."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d2cdb5c03a664aba8b307a52","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cat package.json 2>/dev/null | head -40; echo \"---\"; ls"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_78ed33ffe44247a194fc29ec","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"pnpm test 2>&1 | tail -30"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/glm-5.2","usage":{"input":642,"output":4907,"cacheRead":6592,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4846,"totalTokens":12141,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784969818884,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-d58f70dd-382d-4097-8072-ca33a188e0f3","responseModel":"z-ai/glm-5.2"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d2cdb5c03a664aba8b307a52","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"tdd-experiment-run\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"vitest run\",\n    \"test:unit:basic\": \"vitest run\",\n    \"test:watch\": \"vitest\",\n    \"test:coverage\": \"vitest run --coverage --coverage.reporter=json-summary\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.3.0\",\n    \"tsx\": \"^4.7.0\",\n    \"vitest\": \"^1.0.0\",\n    \"@vitest/coverage-v8\": \"^1.0.0\",\n    \"eslint\": \"^9.0.0\",\n    \"eslint-plugin-sonarjs\": \"^1.0.0\",\